{"type":"message","id":"60c552b8","parentId":"25185426","timestamp":"2026-06-21T03:12:18.176Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The HEARTBEAT.md is already loaded in the workspace context. Let me review its contents:\n\n1. **健康督促任务** - 每天督促老公跑步锻炼，时间建议17:00-17:30\n2. **调度器心跳监测** - 监测 reminder_scheduler.py 进程是否存活\n3. **一日作息督促** - 包括起床、三餐、午睡、睡觉等时间表\n\nCurrent time: 11:12 AM (Asia/Shanghai). According to the schedule:\n- 11:00-12:30 → 吃午餐 🍚\n\nThis falls in the 午餐提醒 time slot. I need to:\n1. Check if the reminder scheduler process is alive\n2. Remind 老公 about lunch\n\nBut wait - this is a heartbeat channel (direct chat with heartbeat provider). Let me think about this more carefully.\n\nThe HEARTBEAT.md says:\n- 调度器心跳监测: check if reminder_scheduler.py is running\n- 一日作息督促: 11:00-12:30 → 吃午餐\n\nThe instructions say \"Handle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\" - but that's for the scheduled reminder messages. This is a regular heartbeat check.\n\nActually, looking at the current time: 11:12 AM falls in the 11:00-12:30 lunch time slot. According to HEARTBEAT.md, I should check the scheduler process and maybe remind about lunch.\n\nBut this is a heartbeat poll - the instruction says \"If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK\". The lunch reminder is something that needs attention though.\n\nLet me first check if the reminder scheduler is alive, then handle the lunch reminder.\n\nActually, let me re-read the heartbeat instructions more carefully. The system says \"Read HEARTBEAT.md if it exists. Follow it strictly.\" The HEARTBEAT.md has specific tasks. The lunch reminder is at 11:00-12:30 and it's now 11:12 AM - so the lunch reminder should trigger.\n\nI should:\n1. Check the scheduler process (pgrep -f reminder_scheduler.py)\n2. Send a lunch reminder\n\nLet me check the scheduler first, and then send the reminder.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"